Davis was found late on December 29th in rough terrain past the dead end of a forested road in the area. Her dog, Cami, kept her warm and signaled to Lane County Sheriff&rsquo;s Search &amp;amp; Rescue volunteers as they searched the area.&lt;br /&gt;
