&lt;div class="_1mf _1mj" style="position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: inherit;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:inherit"&gt;The vehicle ran over the spikes and all four tires deflated, slowing the vehicle. The driver, Racheal Anne Katlyn Obert, 30, of Oakridge, jumped from the vehicle as it was still moving. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
