&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;The investigation is ongoing, and further inquiries should be directed to the Marion County District Attorney&rsquo;s Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;###&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
