&lt;p style="margin-left:6.0pt"&gt;The public notice, meeting agenda, and related documents are available at: &lt;a href="https://www.oregon.gov/dogami/mlrr/Pages/Calico-GrassyMtn_projectDocuments.aspx"&gt;https://www.oregon.gov/dogami/mlrr/Pages/Calico-GrassyMtn_projectDocuments.aspx&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

